{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>SOLAR 是一款結合日光倒數、黃金時刻與太陽月亮位置的 iPhone 應用程式，適合喜歡戶外活動、攝影或需要規劃日照時間的使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-283.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>掌握日照與天空變化</h2>\n<p>使用者可查看指定地點的日出、太陽正午與日落，並以倒數掌握下一個日出或日落，亦可探索黃金時刻、藍色時刻及暮光變化。應用程式可滑動瀏覽晝夜與季節，查看月相、太陽與月亮路徑，以及太陽位置隨年份的變化。支援 AR 的 iPhone 可透過相機查看太陽與月亮位置，並以小工具掌握日光與月相。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-352-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-353-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-354-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-355-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-356-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-357-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：SOLAR: Sun Tracker &amp; Time</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/solar-sun-tracker-time/id6810464367?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T10:17:08.283308+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":300,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T10:02:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T14:54:03.830064+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T10:10:45.712476+00:00","content_hash":"9a869e51f27fe476d48dc878386da1848acb543e16ee09313aeb05343fc71848","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}